{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S05、S11—S14等段仍有感受短语偏多的问题，连续读故事不如Y左栏顺畅，部分细节容易来不及消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X把叙事拆成较短的句子，并用放大加亮的关键词标出心理变化，普通观众即使不逐字阅读，也比较容易抓住每段发生了什么、人物为什么这样反应。感受部分又有与具体音乐段落对应的出现时机，音乐质感、身体感受和心理变化之间的联系更细致，能听出情绪如何一步步转变。Y的连续叙述更自然流畅，但右侧感受较多停留在并列标签，音乐细节与人物心理之间的对应没有X那么丰富。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3da5b442-4571-4170-911a-1b92b8e626a1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T205613129752Z", "elapsed_seconds": 174.235, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:59:07.375587+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "01844e616a89808b44fdcddbad1e01e3d4211125bf148d6567436e6f916a8cb8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attac